      "worked_solution": "Note that $\\angle AOD$ is a straight angle and $\\angle BOC$ is a right angle. Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠AOD={180}^{∘},\\,m∠BOC={90}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠AOB+m∠BOC+m∠COD & =m∠AOD \\\\ x+{90}^{∘}+(2x-{30}^{∘}) & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ 3x+{60}^{∘} & ={180}^{∘} \\\\ 3x & ={120}^{∘} \\\\ x & ={40}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
